data: {"id": "4031c45963d64c5a-thinking-parallel_evidence-942", "run_id": "4031c45963d64c5a", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 采集事实\n\n1. **Pod 生命周期 (Metrics)**：`kube_pod_status_phase` 确认 Pod 当前 `phase=Pending` (value=1)，无 Running/Succeeded/Failed 状态。重启次数未返回非零值，说明从未进入 Running。\n2. **调度事件 (Describe)**：`FailedScheduling` 事件重复 12 次，持续 56 分钟。明确原因：`0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient cpu.` 预emption 也无可用受害者。\n3. **Pod Spec (YAML)**：\n   - Container `app` requests: **memory 8Mi** (无 CPU requests，只有 limits: **cpu 100k, memory 32Mi**)。\n   - Node-Selectors: `<none>`\n   - Tolerations: 仅 `node.kubernetes.io/not-ready:NoExecute`\n ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789108188864, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "4031c45963d64c5a-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "4031c45963d64c5a", "seq": 943, "ts_ms": 1789108199387, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 34.994, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-v01", "name": "workload"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/4031c45963d64c5a-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "a8f1ddf9e1fde5969cd450263aaf2961177a72c26e9d81abd9aaa242857f8b53", "bytes": 2419}, "snapshot_sha256": "903b679e27c482645980f2a69d245d9d47cabf8e90c3e4ca4c76c7b09d343581"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

